title: $:/themes/wikilabs/slant-01/history

V 0.5.0 2026.05.15

* No longer deprecated. Modernised to use TW core templates as much as possible
* Slant look reduced to a compact title bar with controls absolutely positioned (CSS-only relative to core DOM)
* Subtitle (modifier + ISO modified date) is now rendered inline beside the title and wraps below when the title is long
* Tag pills now open the Tiddler Info panel on the Tag Map tab directly, instead of the core dropdown
* Standalone tag row hides while the Tag Map tab is open in the info panel, so tags are not duplicated
* Removed redundant overrides: ViewTemplate, ViewTemplate/controls, ViewTemplate/info, ViewTemplate/tags, $:/tags/ViewTemplate, wikilabs/macros/tabs-state

